# =============================================================================
#  Mosquitto ACL -- Smart Guardian System
#
#  The board's credential is scoped to this project's topic tree only. Even if
#  the password leaked, the holder could not read or publish anywhere else on
#  the broker. This goes beyond the brief's "dedicated user with a password"
#  requirement and is cheap to add.
# =============================================================================

# --- the board -----------------------------------------------------------
# Publishes telemetry, person counts, alarms, its own status and events.
user guardian
topic write telemetry/402170516/home
topic write persons/402170516/home
topic write alarm/402170516/home
topic write status/402170516/home
topic write event/402170516/home
# Subscribed to nothing: the board never takes commands over MQTT, only over
# the authenticated REST API. Narrower attack surface.

# --- the laptop's viewer --------------------------------------------------
# Read-only across the whole project tree.
user viewer
topic read telemetry/402170516/home
topic read persons/402170516/home
topic read alarm/402170516/home
topic read status/402170516/home
topic read event/402170516/home
# $SYS lets the viewer show broker health during the demo.
topic read $SYS/#

# No `topic` lines outside a `user` block, so unauthenticated access grants
# nothing even if allow_anonymous were ever turned back on by accident.
